---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="DAJC Platform Testing 2027 — Register now"
  description="Register now to participate in DAJC Platform pre-production testing from 4 January 2027. For heavy and oversized transport professionals and companies across Europe."
>
  <main class="testing-page">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="testing-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">DAJC PLATFORM TESTING · REGISTRATION OPEN</p>
      <h1 id="testing-title">Help test the production DAJC Platform while it is being built.</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Pre-production testing starts on <strong>Monday, 4 January 2027</strong>.
        Registration is open now for relevant professionals and companies involved in heavy and oversized transport.
      </p>
      <div class="principles" aria-label="Testing programme principles">
        <span>Same production product</span>
        <span>No separate pilot edition</span>
        <span>No Early Access edition</span>
        <span>Registered relevant participants</span>
      </div>
      <a class="primary-cta" href="#register">Register for testing</a>
    </section>

    <section class="explain">
      <div>
        <p class="section-kicker">WHO SHOULD REGISTER</p>
        <h2>Built with the people who actually move complex freight.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="role-grid">
        <article><h3>Carriers & fleets</h3><p>Heavy and oversized transport companies, owner-drivers and fleet operators.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Dispatchers & drivers</h3><p>People who plan, coordinate and execute transports every day.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Shippers & industry</h3><p>Industrial customers and logistics teams ordering complex transports.</p></article>
        <article><h3>Specialist services</h3><p>Escort operators, permit specialists, crane companies and route professionals.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="model">
      <p class="section-kicker">HOW IT WORKS</p>
      <h2>One product. Real feedback. Continuous development.</h2>
      <p>
        Participants do not receive a simplified pilot product. They test the same DAJC Platform product
        intended for production while it is under active development. Features, data coverage and workflows
        may change as validation progresses. Testing participation itself is not a commercial production service.
      </p>
      <p>
        Feedback will be used to validate D-ID workflows, fleet and equipment handling, DAJC AI,
        route and restriction intelligence, permits, documents, execution workflows and other capabilities
        relevant to heavy and oversized transport.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="register" id="register" aria-labelledby="register-title">
      <div class="register-copy">
        <p class="section-kicker">REGISTER NOW</p>
        <h2 id="register-title">DAJC Platform Testing 2027</h2>
        <p>
          Complete the registration below. Registration details are delivered to
          <a href="mailto:platform@dajc.eu">platform@dajc.eu</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="start-date"><strong>Testing starts 4 January 2027.</strong></p>
      </div>

      <form id="testing-form" class="testing-form">
        <div class="field-row">
          <label>
            <span>Name *</span>
            <input name="fullName" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Company *</span>
            <input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="160" required />
          </label>
        </div>

        <div class="field-row">
          <label>
            <span>Business email *</span>
            <input name="businessEmail" type="email" autocomplete="email" maxlength="254" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Country *</span>
            <input name="country" autocomplete="country-name" maxlength="120" required />
          </label>
        </div>

        <fieldset>
          <legend>Your role * <small>(select all that apply)</small></legend>
          <div class="check-grid">
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Transport company / carrier" /> Transport company / carrier</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Dispatcher" /> Dispatcher</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Driver" /> Driver</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Shipper / industrial customer" /> Shipper / industrial customer</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Escort / pilot vehicle operator" /> Escort / pilot vehicle operator</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Permit specialist" /> Permit specialist</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Crane / lifting company" /> Crane / lifting company</label>
            <label><input type="checkbox" name="role" value="Other relevant specialist" /> Other relevant specialist</label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <div class="field-row">
          <label>
            <span>Main operation type</span>
            <input name="operationType" maxlength="180" placeholder="e.g. heavy haulage, machinery, wind, industrial projects" />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span>Fleet / organisation size</span>
            <input name="fleetSize" maxlength="80" placeholder="Optional" />
          </label>
        </div>

        <label>
          <span>What is the biggest problem in your current heavy / oversized transport workflow?</span>
          <textarea name="biggestProblem" maxlength="2500" rows="5" placeholder="Optional — this helps DAJC prioritise real operational problems."></textarea>
        </label>

        <label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
          <span>Website</span>
          <input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
        </label>

        <label class="consent">
          <input type="checkbox" name="consent" required />
          <span>
            I have read the <a href="/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DAJC privacy notice</a>
            and agree that the information I submit may be used to administer my DAJC Platform testing registration. *
          </span>
        </label>

        <input type="hidden" name="source" value="dajc.eu/testing" />

        <button type="submit">Register for DAJC Platform Testing 2027</button>
        <p id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <p class="fallback">
          If the form is unavailable, email <a href="mailto:platform@dajc.eu?subject=DAJC%20Platform%20Testing%202027%20registration">platform@dajc.eu</a>.
        </p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    const form = document.querySelector('#testing-form');
    const status = document.querySelector('#form-status');

    form?.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
      event.preventDefault();
      if (!(form instanceof HTMLFormElement) || !(status instanceof HTMLElement)) return;

      const roles = [...form.querySelectorAll('input[name="role"]:checked')];
      if (roles.length === 0) {
        status.textContent = 'Please select at least one role.';
        status.dataset.state = 'error';
        return;
      }

      const button = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
      if (button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
        button.disabled = true;
        button.textContent = 'Sending registration…';
      }
      status.textContent = '';
      status.dataset.state = '';

      const data = new FormData(form);
      const payload: Record<string, unknown> = Object.fromEntries(data.entries());
      payload.role = roles.map((input) => input instanceof HTMLInputElement ? input.value : '').filter(Boolean);
      payload.consent = data.get('consent') === 'on';

      try {
        const response = await fetch('/api/testing-register', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });
        const result = await response.json();

        if (!response.ok || !result.ok) {
          throw new Error(result.error || 'Registration could not be sent.');
        }

        form.reset();
        status.textContent = 'Registration received. Thank you — DAJC Platform testing starts 4 January 2027.';
        status.dataset.state = 'success';
      } catch (error) {
        const message = error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Registration could not be sent.';
        status.innerHTML = `${message} Please email <a href="mailto:platform@dajc.eu?subject=DAJC%20Platform%20Testing%202027%20registration">platform@dajc.eu</a>.`;
        status.dataset.state = 'error';
      } finally {
        if (button instanceof HTMLButtonElement) {
          button.disabled = false;
          button.textContent = 'Register for DAJC Platform Testing 2027';
        }
      }
    });
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .testing-page {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 3rem));
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) 0 6rem;
  }

  .hero {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem);
  }

  .eyebrow, .section-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--dajc-orange);
  }

  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    color: var(--dajc-white);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 18ch;
    margin: 0 auto 1.4rem;
    font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 4.6rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 .55rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .lead, .model p, .register-copy p, .role-grid p {
    color: var(--dajc-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin: 0 auto 1.8rem;
    font-size: 17px;
  }

  .principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: .6rem;
    margin: 0 auto 1.8rem;
  }

  .principles span {
    padding: .55rem .75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--dajc-white);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }

  .primary-cta, .testing-form button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--dajc-orange);
    color: var(--dajc-dark);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .primary-cta { padding: 0 1.3rem; }

  .explain, .model, .register {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem) 0;
  }

  .role-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .role-grid article {
    padding: 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }

  .role-grid p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; }

  .model { max-width: 820px; }
  .model p { margin: .7rem 0; }

  .register {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.35fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .register-copy {
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }

  .register-copy a, .testing-form a { color: var(--dajc-orange); }

  .start-date {
    padding: 1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--dajc-orange);
    background: rgba(239,125,0,.08);
  }

  .testing-form {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    padding: clamp(1.2rem, 4vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(0,20,52,.55);
  }

  .field-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  label, fieldset { display: grid; gap: .45rem; }
  label > span, legend {
    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--dajc-white);
  }

  legend small { color: var(--dajc-muted); }

  input, textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: rgba(0, 10, 30, .75);
    color: var(--dajc-white);
    padding: .8rem .85rem;
    font: inherit;
  }

  input:focus, textarea:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--dajc-orange);
    outline-offset: 1px;
  }

  fieldset {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dajc-line);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .check-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: .65rem 1rem;
  }

  .check-grid label, .consent {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: .6rem;
    color: var(--dajc-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .check-grid input, .consent input {
    width: auto;
    margin-top: .2rem;
    accent-color: var(--dajc-orange);
  }

  .testing-form button {
    width: 100%;
    padding: .8rem 1rem;
  }

  .testing-form button:disabled {
    opacity: .65;
    cursor: wait;
  }

  .form-status, .fallback {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .form-status[data-state="success"] { color: #72d69d; }
  .form-status[data-state="error"] { color: #ffb3a8; }
  .fallback { color: var(--dajc-muted); }
  .honeypot { position: absolute !important; left: -10000px !important; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .role-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .register { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .register-copy { position: static; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 620px) {
    .testing-page { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1120px); }
    .field-row, .check-grid, .role-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
